  "description": {
    "text": "The Shaymin LV.X Collection Pack, one of three fixed packs of 12 cards released together on 18 April 2009. They brought back promotional cards that had become hard to get, alongside Pokémon LV.X, and half of each pack's cards are holo. Shaymin LV.X itself has the artwork of an English tin promo, which no Japanese card had used before. All three packs share a holo Time-Space Distortion.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon Card Game official site, archived: ポケモンカードゲーム コレクションパック シェイミLV．X",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20090322225511/http://www.pokemon-card.com/products/dpt/dpt_04.html"
      },
      {
